# The startup screen, standing in a real project: what gluon found there.
Shot hero
Alt gluon starting in a Go project: the wordmark and version, a row each for the scratchpad it opened, the module it attached to, the database it found and the plugins the project's build list turned on, then a line of the project's own code evaluated at the prompt
Caption gluon is a REPL for Go that compiles every line with your real toolchain — and stands in your project, internal/ packages and all.
